Recommended Mitigations

One of the following should be enforced:

Require bytes32(toAddress) == bytes32(uint256(uint160(toAddress)))

Explicitly reject any bytes32 with non-zero high bits

Use address types end-to-end where EVM-only semantics are intended

Introduce a canonicalization helper with strict checks

